From eebd3b58cd75aafe8a376a4646839d369d0f3e28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jgrizon
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:18:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gpu: VICTORY_SPILL_ONLY keeps just the named shader
 containers

With VICTORY_SPILL_SHADERS=1 the title's tens of thousands of containers would
fill the cache; VICTORY_SPILL_ONLY=a0f0a3c9,7778fb12 keeps only those whose
BLAKE3 starts with one of the prefixes. For correlating an AGXMetal
"unlowered function call" pipeline with the DXIL we emitted: the log's 16-hex
hash is the container hash's prefix, so one diagnostic run yields exactly the
failing containers to translate offline.

Ported from paveledits/ScarlettMac runtime-preview/checkpoint/patches/0009-gpu-VICTORY_SPILL_ONLY-keeps-just-the-named-shader-c.patch

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
